#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:6
msgid "Working with ProxyArray"
msgstr "使用 ProxyArray"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:10
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab data classes return :class:`ProxyArray` — a lightweight, warp-"
"first wrapper that provides zero-copy access to simulation data as either a "
":class:`warp.array` or a :class:`torch.Tensor`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 数据类返回 :class:`ProxyArray` ，这是以 Warp 为基础的轻量封装，可将仿真数据作为 "
":class:`warp.array` 或 :class:`torch.Tensor` 零拷贝访问。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:16
msgid ""
"``ProxyArray`` is inspired by the ``ProxyArray`` class from `mujocolab/mjlab"
" <https://github.com/mujocolab/mjlab>`_ (BSD-3-Clause). The design adapts "
"the same dual-accessor pattern to Isaac Lab's warp-based data pipeline."
msgstr ""
"``ProxyArray`` 的设计参考了 `mujocolab/mjlab "
"<https://github.com/mujocolab/mjlab>`_ 中的 ``ProxyArray`` 类（BSD-3-Clause "
"许可），将同样的双访问器模式用于 Isaac Lab 基于 Warp 的数据管线。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:22
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:24
msgid ""
"Every property on asset and sensor data classes (e.g., "
"``robot.data.joint_pos``, ``sensor.data.net_normal_forces_w``) returns a "
"``ProxyArray``:"
msgstr ""
"资产和传感器数据类的每个属性，例如 ``robot.data.joint_pos`` 、 "
"``sensor.data.net_normal_forces_w`` ，都会返回 ``ProxyArray`` ："

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:43
msgid "The ``.torch`` and ``.warp`` Accessors"
msgstr "``.torch`` 与 ``.warp`` 访问器"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:45
msgid ""
"``.torch`` returns a cached, zero-copy :class:`torch.Tensor` view of the "
"underlying warp array (via :func:`warp.to_torch`). The tensor is created on "
"first access and reused on subsequent calls. Since it is a zero-copy view, "
"writes to the tensor are visible through the warp array and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"``.torch`` 通过 :func:`warp.to_torch` ，返回底层 Warp 数组的缓存式零拷贝 "
":class:`torch.Tensor` 视图。张量在首次访问时创建，后续调用复用。由于是零拷贝视图，修改张量也会反映在 Warp 数组中，反之亦然。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:50
msgid ""
"``.warp`` returns the original :class:`warp.array`. Use this when you need "
"to pass data to warp kernels explicitly or access warp-specific attributes "
"(``ptr``, ``strides``, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"``.warp`` 返回原始 :class:`warp.array` 。需要显式向 Warp 核函数传入数据，或访问 ``ptr`` 、 "
"``strides`` 等 Warp 专用属性时，使用此访问器。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:55
msgid "Deprecation Bridge"
msgstr "弃用过渡兼容机制"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:57
msgid ""
"To ease migration, ``ProxyArray`` includes a deprecation bridge that allows "
"existing code to treat it as a ``torch.Tensor`` temporarily:"
msgstr "为方便迁移， ``ProxyArray`` 提供弃用过渡兼容机制，让旧代码可以暂时将其当作 ``torch.Tensor`` 使用："

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:74
msgid ""
"The ``wp.to_torch()`` compatibility path is a temporary shim for code that "
"was migrated before ``ProxyArray`` exposed explicit accessors. It returns "
"the same zero-copy tensor as ``.torch`` and emits a one-time "
"``DeprecationWarning``. The shim and the other deprecation bridges will be "
"removed in a future release. Migrate to explicit ``.torch`` access now."
msgstr ""
"``wp.to_torch()`` 兼容路径是临时适配层，用于在 ``ProxyArray`` 提供显式访问器之前已迁移的代码。它返回与 "
"``.torch`` 相同的零拷贝张量，并发出一次 ``DeprecationWarning`` "
"。此适配层和其他弃用兼容机制将在后续版本移除。请现在迁移到显式 ``.torch`` 访问。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:81
msgid "Migrating from Isaac Lab 2.x"
msgstr "从 Isaac Lab 2.x 迁移"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:83
msgid ""
"In Isaac Lab 2.x, data properties returned ``torch.Tensor`` directly. In "
"3.0, they return ``ProxyArray``. Append ``.torch`` to get the tensor:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 2.x 的数据属性直接返回 ``torch.Tensor`` ；3.0 则返回 ``ProxyArray`` 。追加 "
"``.torch`` 即可获取张量："

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:98
msgid ""
"Passing a ``ProxyArray`` to ``wp.to_torch()`` is temporarily supported by a "
"compatibility shim and returns the same cached zero-copy tensor as "
"``.torch``. This path emits a one-time ``DeprecationWarning`` and will be "
"removed in a future release. Use ``.torch`` in new code."
msgstr ""
"临时兼容层允许向 ``wp.to_torch()`` 传入 ``ProxyArray`` ，返回与 ``.torch`` "
"相同的缓存式零拷贝张量。该路径会发出一次 ``DeprecationWarning`` ，并将在后续版本移除。新代码应使用 ``.torch`` 。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:105
msgid "Backend Differences"
msgstr "后端差异"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:107
msgid ""
"While the ``ProxyArray`` interface is identical across backends, the "
"underlying data refresh model differs:"
msgstr "各后端的 ``ProxyArray`` 接口相同，但底层数据刷新方式不同："

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:110
msgid "**PhysX (pull-to-refresh):**"
msgstr "**PhysX（访问时拉取刷新）：**"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:111
msgid ""
"Properties pull fresh data from the PhysX tensor API on first access per "
"simulation step, then cache the result. The underlying GPU buffers are "
"stable and pre-allocated — the ``ProxyArray`` wrapper is created once and "
"reused safely across steps."
msgstr ""
"每个仿真步中首次访问属性时，会从 PhysX 张量 API 拉取最新数据并缓存结果。底层 GPU 缓冲区稳定且已预分配，因此 "
"``ProxyArray`` 封装只创建一次，可安全地跨步复用。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:115
msgid "**Newton (auto-refresh with wrapper replacement):**"
msgstr "**Newton（自动刷新并替换封装）：**"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:116
msgid ""
"The simulation automatically refreshes GPU buffers each step. On full "
"simulation resets, buffers may be re-created. The Newton backend creates new"
" ``ProxyArray`` wrappers for the new warp arrays, invalidating any "
"previously cached torch tensors."
msgstr ""
"仿真每步自动刷新 GPU 缓冲区。完整仿真重置时，可能重新创建缓冲区。Newton 后端会为新的 Warp 数组创建新的 ``ProxyArray`` "
"封装，使此前缓存的 Torch 张量失效。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:120
msgid ""
"In both cases, ``.torch`` always returns a view of the current simulation "
"state for the current step."
msgstr "两种情况下， ``.torch`` 始终返回当前步中当前仿真状态的视图。"

#: source/how-to/proxy_array.rst:125
msgid ""
"Do not cache ``.torch`` results across simulation resets. After a reset "
"(especially on Newton), previously obtained tensors may point to stale or "
"freed GPU memory. Always re-access the property after a reset."
msgstr ""
"不要跨仿真重置缓存 ``.torch`` 的结果。重置后（尤其是 Newton），此前获取的张量可能指向过时或已释放的 GPU "
"内存。重置后务必重新访问属性。"

