#: ../../IsaacLab/source/isaaclab/isaaclab/utils/warp/proxy_array.py:docstring
#: of isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray.torch:7
msgid ""
"When the underlying warp array has dtype ``wp.quatf`` and the "
"``WARN_ON_TORCH_QUATF_ACCESS`` environment variable is set to ``\"1\"``, "
"each read emits a :class:`UserWarning` pointing at the call site. This is a "
"runtime aid for migrating Isaac Lab 2.x code (which used the ``(w, x, y, "
"z)`` quaternion convention) to Isaac Lab 3.x's ``(x, y, z, w)`` convention."
msgstr ""
